Postgres MCP Pro (crystaldba/postgres-mcp)
  Run from its own isolated uv-managed venv; not in requirements.txt.
  A development-machine convenience; nothing in the service depends on it.

pgvector/pgvector:pg16 (Docker image)
  The local development database. PostgreSQL License + pgvector's PostgreSQL
  License. Pulled at runtime by docker compose; not redistributed here.
